    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1157,
        1725,
        1302
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you know, we have made great strides in improving and refining our budgetary system from the conventional line type to a program and line type system.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2611,
          "min": -1.3871
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0041,
          "min": -0.1132
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9509,
        "area_px": 211410,
        "density": 0.04498,
        "chars": 153,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.09
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1325,
        1783,
        1509
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In the budget for the coming fiscal year, practically all city agencies are now presented on a combined program and line basis. In addition, for the first time, there are included in this budget, work load performance data for the operating programs of fifteen city agencies.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2158,
          "min": -1.4029
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0006
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 19056,
        "area_px": 280460,
        "density": 0.06795,
        "chars": 275,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.43
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128,
        1533,
        1836,
        1936
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to proceed in a systematic manner and to coordinate this budget development on a city-wide basis we created this past year, with the approval of the Board of Estimate, a separate unit in the Bureau of the Budget. This unit, known as the Performance Standards and Research Unit, has for its mission the overall planning, general direction, installation and coordination of this city-wide performance standards development program. This program must, of necessity, be an agency cooperative project with the Bureau of the Budget providing the necessary guidance, assistance, advice and training for the joint evaluation of standards, work measurement techniques, records and reports.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2188,
          "min": -1.5739
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 122,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0022
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 52889,
        "area_px": 632307,
        "density": 0.08364,
        "chars": 689,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.03
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        134,
        1958,
        1758,
        2355
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In general, the program which is to be established on a permanent basis in all agencies, includes the identification and definition of departmental activities; the selection and defining of meaningful and measurable performance or work units for each activity; the installation of simple but adequate record keeping systems to obtain data on input and output in terms of the work units selected; the study and analysis of the data obtained for the development of performance standards; and the installation of necessary reporting systems to provide for supervisory, executive and management control and decision regarding each program.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2735,
          "min": -1.4068
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 106,
          "mean": -0.0024,
          "min": -0.2553
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 48253,
        "area_px": 591927,
        "density": 0.08152,
        "chars": 635,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.16
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        134,
        2383,
        1859,
        2568
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you can well see this is a gigantic task, broad in scope and requiring technical knowledge and study together with patience and understanding. I cannot impress upon you too strongly the need of your top level support and direction.",
